# ResMate Use Case Development

Globs match **live artifacts at workspace root** — not `examples/` (reference only).

Read [README.md](../../README.md) and the [Master Router & Index](../skills/resmate-use-case/SKILL.md) before editing. Architecture decisions (single/multi-agent, standard flow vs. workflow, JS vs. FaaS) and ReAct sequence flows live in [decision-matrix.md](../skills/resmate-use-case/docs/decision-matrix.md).

## Where to develop

| Location | Role |
|----------|------|
| `tools/`, `agents/`, `assistants/`, `hitl/` at workspace root | Your live artifacts |
| `examples/` | Reference samples only |

## Platform model

- **Assistant** routes agents — `systemContext`
- **Agent** picks tools — `systemInstructions` + `skills[]`
- HITL two-step: [decision-matrix.md](../skills/resmate-use-case/docs/decision-matrix.md)

