## Conventions

- Push order: **hitl → workflow → tool → agent → assistant** — see [push-pull-wire.md](../skills/resmate-use-case/docs/push-pull-wire.md) for binding rules and the push-wire-re-push loop.
- Never invent MongoDB ObjectIds for `id` fields or `skills[]`/`agents[]` bindings — leave them empty and let push write them back. See [id-lifecycle.md](../skills/resmate-use-case/docs/id-lifecycle.md).
- Run `resmate` from **workspace root**
- State: [spec-workflow.md](../skills/resmate-use-case/docs/spec-workflow.md) — no custom persistence; workflow save tools return `workflowPatch` only

